WEBVTT

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:03.130
Their applications are far-reaching
and not limited to the space missions

00:05:03.163 --> 00:05:04.830
to which they are designed.

00:05:04.863 --> 00:05:06.063
To prove it to you,

00:05:06.063 --> 00:05:08.863
here are some technologies
that we use every day on Earth

00:05:08.897 --> 00:05:11.763
that were originally developed
for space missions:

00:05:11.797 --> 00:05:14.197
cheaper and quieter artificial limbs,

00:05:14.197 --> 00:05:15.930
smartphone cameras,

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:17.663
firefighting equipment,

00:05:17.697 --> 00:05:20.930
baby formula, memory foam,
advanced solar cells,

00:05:20.963 --> 00:05:23.597
better LASIK surgery, water filters,

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.530
scratch-resistant lenses, air purifiers.

00:05:26.563 --> 00:05:28.663
The list goes on and on.

00:05:28.697 --> 00:05:31.597
These technologies help us
fight climate change, pollution,